    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Danyka",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104174569973888201078/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVK61-tCMnm9-R-Ad2l65Aj22B1mbmrVqRMRJhAqty4nII2FKY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Worst customer service I’ve ever experienced. Last weekend, the older man at the hunting counter spoke to me like I was trash when I was just trying to buy bullets and a gun, with my kids. He was extremely rude. I swore I wouldn’t come back, but today I went in to buy my hunting license. The woman at the service cash was just as rude, acting like I was bothering her. On top of that, their system wasn’t even working so I couldn’t get my permits.\n\nInstead of leaving, I decided to check out the hunting department again, and the woman at the cash actually told me multiple times: “The exit is there!” in a rude, condescending tone, basically kicking me out of the store.\n\nI’ve spent thousands of dollars here, I’m an avid hunter, and I was about to buy a new firearm—but this was the final straw. I will never step foot in this store again.",
        "time": 1758305965,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Luc Bissonnette",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109501047331828704373/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLgD3GfyE4i71PIwLZGJmENhZApiM76OpdHYr3MatX1nFaB7A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Beautiful store.  Clean.  Tidy.  Perfect place for outdoor équipement.  A little pricey but generally good quality.",
        "time": 1764718624,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "New Mood",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105633853857212917605/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI_IW-1mtuAp7jZOIV62j7ihKicmYfg8mr5wITX3_PrjnMHfQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Good collection but understaffed. I wad to wait more than 10 minutes to get assistance with winter boots.",
        "time": 1768688432,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Keith Wilson",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106933531267523473914/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKzRI0Q4zolcb9Gl-5hNc0GIw2EL8DWfQNBp6--V-1Cskk9Ng=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Great knowledge of their products from tents to rifles to kayaks to binoculars. Always greeted with a hello and a friendly smile. I spend too much to justify here as many others and as a whole supplier to many outdoor products they could be a lot more competitive in pricing or add some type of loyalty to customers.",
        "time": 1657676554,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Silvia Di Marco",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105285783259787423040/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXZ-R08rwh3RF3Ye9RebX6Y35svaaJzTdxGuyV7NyLIY3C6tcM9=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
